      "repository_source_sha256": "749d98421d8162e80b4242679a40cae9eee06d1bc1b7dc410f02abc827e90552",
      "en": "「Never thought you'd be a weak woman who quits after one game over-」"
    },
    "336:24424": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9f0fa0b59363aa4dce28294ff36beb2ae490f74666ab3815f683dcdae49e8d18",
      "en": "「Next is the player. 'Persuasion' by threat to play 36 hours-」"
    },
